---
import ShowLayout from '../layouts/ShowLayout.astro';
---

<ShowLayout>
  <img slot="showImage" src="/images/addamsfamily/addams-large.jpg" alt="The Addams Family" width="400px" />
  <h2 slot="showTitle">The Addams Family</h2>
  <div slot="showDates">March 18 - 20 @ 7:00 PM, March 20 @ 3:00 PM<br />FHC Fine Arts Center</div>
  <div slot="showCopy">
    <p style="font-style:italic;font-size:var(--h4)">"When Love Brings the Outside World to the Mansion, Who Will Embrace the Unexpected?"</p>
    <p>
      FHC Theatre presents The Addams Family – a delightfully dark musical comedy about love, family, and finding beauty in the wonderfully weird. Gomez and Morticia's daughter Wednesday has grown up
      and fallen head over heels for Lucas Beineke, a perfectly ordinary boy from a perfectly ordinary family. When the Addams clan invites the Beinekes over for one unforgettable dinner, secrets spill,
      chaos erupts, and two very different worlds collide. Can love survive when "normal" meets macabre?
    </p>
    <p>
      Our talented student performers bring Charles Addams' iconic characters to life in this splashy, spooky, and heartwarming musical packed with clever humor and unforgettable songs. Witness the clash
      between tradition and change, darkness and daylight, family loyalty and young love – in one of Broadway's most delightfully unconventional family reunions. A story of acceptance and affection that
      will leave you wondering: What makes a family truly happy?
    </p>
  </div>
</ShowLayout>
<script is:inline>
  document.getElementById('nav-musical').classList.add('active');
</script>
<style>
  @media screen and (max-width: 869px) {
    iframe {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
